<title>USA: Cuba-Rushford CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Cuba-Rushford CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc., said it won $8.220 million of Cuba-Rushford CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.7250 percent.</p>
</text>
